Third-party components

The MIT license above covers the authors' original contributions.

The image model, training, evaluation and data-transform code, EDM time grid,
and label pipeline (including continuous paths and ODE solvers) retain or
adapt code from Meta Flow Matching:
https://github.com/facebookresearch/flow_matching
Copyright (c) Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates.
These portions are covered by licenses/CC-BY-NC-4.0.txt.
Modifications include robust training and evaluation, package-relative imports,
CIFAR-10 model configuration, removal of unused branches, and checkpoint handling.

The UNet and neural-network helpers derive from OpenAI guided-diffusion:
https://github.com/openai/guided-diffusion
Copyright (c) 2021 OpenAI.
Its MIT license is reproduced in licenses/OpenAI-guided-diffusion-MIT.txt.
